gurmaden\",\"id\":737120,\"language\":\"tr\",\"name\":\"Doodstream\",\"negative_votes\":0,\"positive_votes\":0,\"quality\":\"regular\",\"season_num\":1,\"source\":\"local\",\"template\":26,\"title_id\":226,\"type\":\"embed\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-10T20:02:17.566Z\",\"url\":\"https://doodstream.com/e/5xgpyuuwmtoa\",\"user_id\":519608,\"__v\":0,\"captions\":[]},{\"_id\":\"6939d1c92289e019c292da76\",\"approved\":true,\"category\":\"full\",\"created_at\":\"2025-12-10T20:02:17.570Z\",\"episode_id\":41936,\"episode_num\":1,\"extra\":\"ugurmaden\",\"id\":737121,\"language\":\"tr\",\"name\":\"Uqload\",\"negative_votes\":0,\"positive_votes\":0,\"quality\":\"regular\",\"season_num\":1,\"source\":\"local\",\"template\":26,\"title_id\":226,\"type\":\"embed\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-10T20:02:17.570Z\",\"url\":\"https://uqload.io/embed-eqlgb2g3lxb0.html\",\"user_id\":519608,\"__v\":0,\"captions\":[]},{\"_id\":\"693a2c22456c198c7cd04ab7\",\"approved\":true,\"category\":\"full\",\"created_at\":\"2025-12-11T02:27:46.322Z\",\"episode_id\":41936,\"episode_num\":1,\"extra\":\"Çevirmen: zafhy | Encoder: Wolwead\",\"id\":737204,\"language\":\"tr\",\"name\":\"Doodstream\",\"negative_votes\":0,\"positive_votes\":0,\"quality\":null,\"season_num\":1,\"source\":\"local\",\"template\":61,\"title_id\":226,\"type\":\"embed\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-11T02:27:46.322Z\",\"url\":\"https://doodstream.com/e/y1yqy5uhd29m\",\"__v\":0,\"captions\":[]},{\"_id\":\"693a2c22456c198c7cd04abc\",\"approved\":true,\"category\":\"full\",\"created_at\":\"2025-12-11T02:27:46.329Z\",\"episode_id\":41936,\"episode_num\":1,\"extra\":\"Çevirmen: zafhy | Encoder: Wolwead\",\"id\":737205,\"language\":\"tr\",\"name\":\"Uqload\",\"negative_votes\":0,\"positive_votes\":0,\"quality\":null,\"season_num\":1,\"source\":\"local\",\"template\":61,\"title_id\":226,\"type\":\"embed\",\"updated_at\":\"2025-12-11T02:27:46.329Z\",\"url\":\"https://uqload.io/embed-lgrtzeqy3nqf.html\",\"__v\":0,\"captions\":[]}],\"translatorPoints\":{\"26\":9.473684210526315,\"61\":9.392857142857142},\"episodeList\":[{\"_id\":\"64d8a9d77354a48fcedf2c94\",\"id\":41936,\"name\":\"1. Bölüm\",\"description\":\"Ergenlerin küçük bir yüzdesi, özel yeteneklerin başlangıcına sahiptir. Yu Otosaka, onurlu bir öğrencinin okul hayatını yaşamak için bir hedefin vücudunu beş saniye boyunca ele geçiren bir yeteneği ustaca kullanır ve prestijli bir liseye kabul edilir. Tam Yu lisede istikrarlı bir hayat yaşamak üzereyken, önünde Nao Tomori adında bir kız belirir ...\",\"old_name\":null,\"old_description\":\"A small percentage of adolescents have onsets of special abilities. Yu Otosaka deftly uses an ability that takes over a target's body for five seconds to live the school life of an honor student, and gets accepted into a prestigious high school. Just when Yu is about to live a stable life in high school, a girl named Nao Tomori appears before him...\",\"translated\":true,\"episode_type\":\"tv\",\"translator_id\":0,\"extra\":\"\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/emaHs6uvIRs2njmY6khRZPXFuvF.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2015-07-05T00:00:00.000Z\",\"title_id\":226,\"season_id\":309,\"season_number\":1,\"episode_number\":1,\"allow_update\":true,\"user_id\":0,\"created_at\":\"2018-11-21T17:03:33.000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2023-01-24T06:25:15.000Z\",\"tmdb_vote_count\":0,\"tmdb_vote_average\":null,\"local_vote_average\":\"10.\",\"year\":2015,\"popularity\":null,\"local_vote_count\":1,\"credits\":[],\"model_type\":\"episode\",\"sub_name\":\"1. Sezon 1. Bölüm\"},{\"_id\":\"64d8a9d77354a48fcedf2c95\",\"id\":41937,\"name\":\"2. Bölüm\",\"description\":\"Yu, öğrenci konseyiyle istemeden hareket eder ve özel yeteneklere sahip bireyleri güvence altına almak için ortalığı kasıp kavurur. Bu, Tomorinin tehlike karşısında öğrenci konseyi görevlerini yerine getirmeye neden kararlı olduğunu ortaya çıkarır - bir yetenek sahibi bekleyen acımasız bir kaderi içeren bir geçmiş.\",\"old_name\":null,\"old_description\":\"Yu unwillingly acts together with the student council and runs amok to secure individuals with special abilities. This brings to light why Tomori is determined to fulfill student council duties in face of danger - a past involving a cruel destiny that awaited an ability wielder.\",\"translated\":true,\"episode_type\":\"tv\",\"translator_id\":0,\"extra\":\"\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dGebUNa84OexUUDoYZtehZj5Q4K.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2015-07-12T00:00:00.000Z\",\"title_id\":226,\"season_id\":309,\"season_number\":1,\"episode_number\":2,\"allow_update\":true,\"user_id\":0,\"created_at\":\"2018-11-21T17:03:33.000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2023-01-24T06:25:18.000Z\",\"tmdb_vote_count\":0,\"tmdb_vote_average\":null,\"local_vote_average\":\"10.\",\"year\":2015,\"popularity\":null,\"local_vote_count\":1,\"credits\":[],\"model_type\":\"episode\",\"sub_name\":\"1. Sezon 2. Bölüm\"}]}"
          },
